/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (1. Log in to the Azure Portal.  2. Search for App Services and click + Create.  3. Choose Subscription & Resource Group.  4. Select App Service Plan and Pricing Tier \(Free/Standard/Premium\).  5. Click Review + Create to deploy. )
/E (1. Log in to the Azure Portal.  2. Search for App Services and click + Create.  3. Choose Subscription & Resource Group.  4. Select App Service Plan and Pricing Tier \(Free/Standard/Premium\).  5. Click Review + Create to deploy. )
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [5]
>>
